step jn6vqv
order 0
author ai
file crates/io-map/src/wire.rs
lines 4 145
hash 2b399193bd0bd9dd
note The directory name, the extension, the version line, the field keys and the conflict markers jj and git write, any of which at a line start stops a read. There is no schema anywhere else, so the layout is this: .codemap/ holds one file per path, <name>.cmap. One field per line as "key value", the value running to the end of the line, with backslash, newline and carriage return escaped as \\\\, \\n and \\r. A blank line ends the path block and each step block. The path block is "codemap 8", "path <name>", "kind flow|layer|type", "author ai|human", then the optional "group <group>" and "note <text>". Each step block is "step <id>", "order <n>" (its place in the step list, ties by id), the optional "parent <id>" (a root has none), "author ai|human", "file <path>", the optional "symbol <name>" (none means absolute lines), "lines <start> <end>" (0-based, from the symbol's first line or absolute), "hash <16 hex digits>", and the optional "link <path name>" and "note <text>". Optional fields are left out when empty and nothing counts anything; a step names its parent by id and holds its place in order, so adding a step changes no other line. Any other version line is rejected: an old map is regenerated, never migrated.

